Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:04.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They say they feel more \Ncomfortable with full invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:11.49,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Though I wouldn't say I prefer \Nbeing fully invisible myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:13.74,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EPISODE 11: THE INVISIBLE PERSON VILLAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.88,0:00:28.45,Main,Driver,0,0,0,,The next stop is Third \NDistrict Shopping Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:30.28,Main,Driver,0,0,0,,Third District Shopping Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.53,0:00:35.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:38.83,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.04,0:00:40.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.10,0:00:43.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry we had to \Nmake so many transfers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:46.01,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,My hometown is really out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.01,0:00:47.19,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.19,0:00:50.32,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'm excited to visit \Nthe invisible person village!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:51.90,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.90,0:00:54.08,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Nothing but fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.08,0:00:55.48,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's very closed off, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.48,0:00:57.66,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.18,0:01:00.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, it's a rather odd village.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:02.61,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,An odd village?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:35.75,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,THIRD DISTRICT SHOPPING STREET
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:41.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,The air is so fresh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:44.26,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, it's a serene, green place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.40,0:02:54.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This is the shopping street.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.29,0:02:59.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see. It's very lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.60,0:03:01.44,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Are these all the locals?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.27,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I sense so many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.27,0:03:08.40,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I should have expected that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.24,0:03:11.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The village is exempted \Nfrom certain laws,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.34,0:03:14.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,so we're allowed to walk around \Nwith full invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.88,0:03:20.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Many of the invisible people who live \Nhere go around like that all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:21.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.86,0:03:27.28,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is the people being fully invisible\N what makes the town odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:29.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, it disorients a lot of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:32.18,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I suppose it's \Nan everyday thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:36.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Oh, my family's house is up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Shizuka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.25,0:03:42.49,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I just got really nervous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I know how you feel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.56,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,but I know you can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.56,0:03:48.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.05,0:03:54.35,Main,Kirikuro,0,0,0,,Is that... Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:04:00.42,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,TONOME
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.12,0:04:21.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Sitting to your left is my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.73,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,To your right is my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.04,0:04:25.73,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I-It's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:30.64,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Akira-san's always quiet, \Nbut they're even quieter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:34.37,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}It's like... a silent pressure...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:35.74,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.74,0:04:39.66,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... My name is Shizuka Yako!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:43.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san is always helping me... um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.68,0:04:46.42,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-It's so good to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:48.65,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.04,0:04:51.66,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Thank you for helping our Akira.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:54.32,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Her voice is so flat and impersonal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:57.85,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Maybe she doesn't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.85,0:05:00.12,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Wh-What do I do, Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:04.11,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We're currently dating \Nand considering living together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.48,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,R-Right to the point?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:07.95,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,Sounds fine to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:10.96,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Yes, it sounds fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:14.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Also, I've been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:18.54,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Why are you wearing those strange masks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:20.54,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Huh? Masks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.77,0:05:25.80,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,You said you'd be bringing \Nanother species by.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.72,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,We thought she'd be more \Ncomfortable if we had faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.72,0:05:31.68,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san is blind. \NThey're not doing much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.88,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,Ah, fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.20,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Yes, fair point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought I told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.63,0:05:39.26,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,I guess she can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.26,0:05:41.00,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Yes, I guess she can't tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.40,0:05:44.27,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Well, this might be okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.76,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,Is it all right if we \Nturn fully invisible, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.00,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.47,0:05:53.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,They say they feel more \Ncomfortable with full invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.67,0:05:56.92,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,Yes. That's the case \Nfor all invisible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:59.74,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.74,0:06:04.64,Main,Takumi,0,0,0,,Fully invisible is how we \Nshould rightly be, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.54,0:06:13.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I should take her to meet \NGrandmother next, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.47,0:06:16.71,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,She's in her room because of her bad leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:28.05,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Though I wouldn't say I prefer \Nbeing fully invisible myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.65,0:06:35.63,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Because you like people \Nto see your favorite outfits, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.92,0:06:40.12,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Later, can I tell you all \Nthe details of the suit I'm wearing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.76,0:06:43.12,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I'd love to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.80,0:06:47.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Grandma, we're coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.63,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.67,0:06:52.59,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,Grandma, Shizuka-san is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.59,0:06:55.80,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,Well, I told them to let you know, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.80,0:06:56.64,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.51,0:07:01.07,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,In the Warring States period,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.72,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,we were a house of ninja \Nwho served our lord well!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:10.44,Main,Ninja,0,0,0,,Ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:13.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You were ninja?! That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:16.74,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,We have shuriken \Nand such in the warehouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:20.08,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,C-Can you do ninjutsu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:26.56,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,Our fully invisible forms certainly \Nseemed like ninjutsu to outsiders!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.13,0:07:30.52,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,But we couldn't make our shuriken \Nand other tools invisible,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.52,0:07:33.22,Main,Grandma,0,0,0,,so we had to use various other tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.36,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.86,0:07:38.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So cool! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.96,Main - Top - Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}She's very excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.96,0:07:38.24,Main,Shoko,0,0,0,,Akira.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.24,0:07:47.36,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Hey. It's been a while, Aki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.96,0:07:50.78,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Kiriguro-san! You're back in town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:52.62,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.62,0:07:55.76,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Hey, you've come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.22,0:07:59.69,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I guess I was still in school \Nthe last time we talked...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.48,0:08:02.36,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,You were such a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.28,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,You surprised me, \Ndressed up in that suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:08.25,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you could \Ntell it was me, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.73,0:08:11.97,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:17.09,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,This is Masashi Kiriguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.31,0:08:19.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Do you remember the story I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,The first invisible person model...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:24.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Oh, that one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:27.30,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,What kind of introduction is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.78,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,We were just talking old times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.78,0:08:33.04,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I retired from modeling. \NNow I run this Italian place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.41,0:08:35.04,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,You surprised me, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.04,0:08:39.03,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I was opening the place up this morning \Nand thought, "Hey, is that Aki?"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.03,0:08:42.74,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm impressed you recognized me. \NIt's been over ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.74,0:08:46.24,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Not many people around here \Nwho don't do full invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:48.47,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I just kinda figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:51.45,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Here, eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.80,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It smells wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:55.96,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Thank you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.36,0:08:58.40,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Did you recognize me, Aki?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.40,0:09:01.30,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I didn't have all this ink \Nthe last time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:03.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I knew you on sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.23,0:09:06.60,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,When you were a child, you drew \Nthe patterns on with a pen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.85,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.85,0:09:12.78,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Guess I haven't changed much either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:17.43,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But you were such a help to me then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.36,0:09:19.98,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Oh, I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:23.74,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,You were crying your eyes out. \N"I dunno who anyone is!"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:26.64,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Come on, you don't have to \Nbring up that part!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:30.99,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You were crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.31,0:09:34.71,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I grew up surrounded by other species.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.59,0:09:39.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,When I was first brought \Nto this village when I was young...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.84,0:09:42.33,Flashback,Auntie 1,0,0,0,,Oh, you're all alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.04,0:09:43.89,Flashback - Top - Italics,Auntie 2,0,0,0,,{\i0}Come over here! I've got some candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.70,Flashback - Top - Italics,Auntie 3,0,0,0,,{\i0}What a cutie-pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.70,0:09:46.89,Flashback - Top - Italics,Auntie 4,0,0,0,,{\i0}Hey, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:46.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Being surrounded by invisible people \Nat all times frightened me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.83,0:09:55.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And then I met Kiriguro-san, \Nwho had drawn on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:58.52,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,You came from the big city, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:11.44,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought, is this kid holding \Na one-man Halloween?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:12.78,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Hey. Lay off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.96,0:10:15.92,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I thought you were such a strange child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:20.14,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But you really set me at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.47,0:10:22.10,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Thinking back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.10,0:10:25.31,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I drew a lot of different \Nthings on my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:28.34,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Not sure how I made it as a model.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:33.28,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,At the time, he modeled fashions \Nas the first invisible model.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.28,0:10:36.21,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I see! He did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:40.75,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Back then, pretty much \Nthe only jobs for invisible people
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.75,0:10:44.09,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,were secret agent stuff \Nor stuff here at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:50.76,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I was curious about the big city, \Nso I packed a bag and went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.18,0:11:03.36,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.36,0:11:05.84,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,There's never been \Nan invisible person model before...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.48,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,I can see some appeal in showing \Noff the outfit's lining...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:10.83,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,Could be pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:14.23,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,But only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.84,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,A moment's intrigue, and then it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:22.76,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,I mean, if invisibility's \Nall you're offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.29,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,I could get any invisible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.12,0:11:32.49,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.50,0:11:37.01,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}Dammit. Another audition down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.29,0:11:39.25,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,Why does it have to be {\i1}you{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.25,0:11:41.64,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}Why it has to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.53,0:11:45.35,Flashback,Orc,0,0,0,,What, did I hit you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.35,0:11:46.40,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,That hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.40,0:11:49.40,Flashback,Orc,0,0,0,,Roll your sleeves down! It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.43,0:11:56.00,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,True enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.94,0:11:58.36,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.36,0:11:59.27,Flashback,Worker 1,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.37,0:12:01.78,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,I mean, if invisibility's \Nall you're offering,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:04.44,Flashback,Designer,0,0,0,,I could get any invisible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.72,0:12:07.35,Flashback,Orc,0,0,0,,Roll your sleeves down! It's not safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.73,0:12:11.30,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}No wonder the people back home \Ndidn't want me to go to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.85,0:12:16.42,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}Life here is too damn hard \Nfor invisible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.66,0:12:36.70,Flashback,Mask 1,0,0,0,,If invisibility's all you're offering, \NI could get any invisible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.43,0:12:40.55,Flashback,Mask 2,0,0,0,,I can't tell anything if I can't see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.55,0:12:42.34,Flashback,Mask 2,0,0,0,,What are you even thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.48,0:12:45.07,Flashback,Mask 1,0,0,0,,Don't you run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:48.80,Flashback,Mask 2,0,0,0,,You came here because you wanted to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:52.71,Flashback,Mask 2,0,0,0,,You should've stayed home \Nand lived a normal life!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:55.63,Flashback,Masks,0,0,0,,It's your fault for leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.96,0:13:41.44,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I feel sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.44,0:13:44.84,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Crap. Big audition today...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:46.03,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Gotta hurry...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:51.05,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,What the hell did I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.56,0:13:54.17,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:56.00,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I've got my audition coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:02.24,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,No freaking way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.70,0:14:05.07,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.52,0:14:09.07,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for coming \Nto the audition looking ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.95,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.22,Flashback - Italics,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,{M}Just reject me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:16.30,Flashback,Designer 2,0,0,0,,You're really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:18.10,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:20.58,Flashback,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,The "moment's intrigue" thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.95,Flashback,Designer 2,0,0,0,,No, you're incredibly interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.95,0:14:24.12,Flashback,Designer 2,0,0,0,,You're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.02,0:14:34.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,You tattooed a skeleton on yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:38.31,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,and added body paint to match \Nwhatever design you were wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.31,0:14:41.72,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,People loved the way it made \Nthe clothing stand out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.87,0:14:46.86,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}I can't imagine it at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:50.87,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,It made the clothing stand out, so I got\Ncalls to model all sorts of collections.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.87,0:14:54.51,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Invisible people tend to get lumped \Nall together because we can't be seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.51,0:14:56.00,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,but thinking back now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:15:00.19,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,the body paint and tattoos were \Nmy own way of expressing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.54,0:15:04.54,Main - Top,sign,0,0,0,,EXPRESSING MYSELF
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.90,0:15:08.71,Flashback,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's the only way I can \Nexpress myself, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.20,0:15:11.34,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Expressing myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.34,0:15:20.06,Italics,Yako,0,0,0,,{M}They're so similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.92,0:15:24.14,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.14,0:15:26.20,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,don't the people of the village struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.20,0:15:28.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,with everyone being \Ninvisible all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:33.03,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Invisible people have an organ that \Nlets them sense other invisible people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.03,0:15:38.29,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,We can sense where they are, \Nand tell who's who.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.29,0:15:41.88,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,But the organ that makes \Nit possible tends to end up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:44.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,underdeveloped in those \Nwho are raised in the city, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:49.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was around elementary \Nschool age when I learned
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:53.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,to identify people by their \Nunique sounds and smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.18,0:15:55.38,Flashback,Yako,0,0,0,,Is that you, Ema-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.38,0:15:57.44,Flashback,Ema,0,0,0,,How did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.44,0:16:01.91,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,It seems like other people can't do that, \Nso it always really surprised them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.13,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.13,0:16:05.77,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I suppose we all adjust \Nto our surroundings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.77,0:16:08.84,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,And since I was raised \Namong non-invisible people...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:09.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.76,0:16:14.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,the reason I learned how to do it isn't \Nbecause I worked really hard at it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:17.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,or that other people \Ndon't work hard at it...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:21.52,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I was just living my life, being blind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.52,0:16:24.45,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,and I guess I adjusted to the need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.45,0:16:26.23,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I know exactly what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:28.25,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.51,0:16:32.18,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Because of that, I was able to find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:33.51,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,So I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.84,0:16:38.60,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Hey, could you take that somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.22,0:16:40.10,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.10,0:16:41.64,Main,Tonome/Yako,0,0,0,,Thank you for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.88,Main,Kiriguro,0,0,0,,Aki, make sure you \Nstop by again sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.88,0:16:45.14,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Yes, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:56.95,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Invisible people tend to\N be judged by their invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.27,0:16:59.10,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}We're treasured because we can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.33,0:17:00.99,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Suspected because\Nwe can't be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.29,0:17:02.36,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}Feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:04.30,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}And ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.32,0:17:09.59,Italics,Tonome,0,0,0,,{M}But that didn't matter to Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.28,0:17:18.32,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.32,0:17:19.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.52,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.64,0:17:26.76,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I-It's not that big a deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:29.02,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,It's just how I feel right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:32.02,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You're always so frank!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:35.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Well, I'm an invisible person...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:38.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I can't express my feelings \Nif I don't say them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:48.92,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Hearing that... makes my heart race...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.20,0:17:54.17,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,All the little things you say \Nand do make my heart race.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.17,0:17:56.09,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,You liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.53,0:17:59.81,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm not lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:12.97,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Good, just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:13.77,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Hey, Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.31,0:18:16.22,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Fu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.96,0:18:20.75,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Why did you want to come all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.78,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Where's Tonome-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:26.29,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,He's not walking you home after work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.29,0:18:29.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He's still working!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.68,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Detective work doesn't \Nhave hard and fast hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.68,0:18:32.70,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.22,0:18:34.83,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.83,0:18:36.72,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Take me somewhere good to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.72,0:18:39.42,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,But it's not payday yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.63,0:18:45.14,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,Dad gave me 10,000 yen for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:46.43,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Then off we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.43,0:18:50.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,I've got some places \Nregistered in my guidance app...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.63,0:18:59.17,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:01.84,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,There's an invisible \Nperson wearing a suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:03.41,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,It could be Tonome-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.97,0:19:05.53,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san's nearby?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:07.49,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,I'll check if it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.82,0:19:10.04,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Check if it's him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:13.89,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:21.13,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,Tonome-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.38,0:19:24.39,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:27.77,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Sis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.77,0:19:29.30,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Welcome back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.30,0:19:31.23,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Well? Was it him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.23,0:19:33.94,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Tonome is a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.33,0:19:35.48,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,I'm gonna bash him good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.48,0:19:37.40,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:41.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Honestly. Tailing Akira-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.24,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,He's a detective. He'll notice you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.24,0:19:45.12,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,He's the one sneaking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:46.87,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,I'll whack him either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:49.08,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,It's probably a marriage scam.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.64,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Akira-san would never \Ndo something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.30,0:19:57.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,And you haven't done enough investigation \Nto confirm that he's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.81,0:20:00.80,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,No, I saw him give her the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.97,0:20:05.31,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Goodness me. You're such \Nan amateur, Fu-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.59,0:20:09.81,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I'm an employee \Nat a detective agency myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.81,0:20:12.31,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,You're an amateur too. \NYou're not a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.90,0:20:15.29,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,They went into a building.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:25.57,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Are you nervous?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.85,0:20:28.45,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,Yes, very.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:37.60,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Fu-kun, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.60,0:20:39.59,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Don't leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.59,0:20:41.41,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Is this glass? A window?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.41,0:20:43.38,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Come on, Fu-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:02.80,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shizuka-san, right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:07.00,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,A-Akira-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.57,0:21:16.50,Main,Futo,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:21.16,Main,Yako,0,0,0,,Um... fancy meeting you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.16,0:21:24.47,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I'm working right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.36,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Can we talk later?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:29.01,Main,Futa,0,0,0,,Working?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.97,0:21:37.00,Main,Catman,0,0,0,,Um, I'm sorry to interrupt, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:38.40,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,Big Brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:44.77,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,I've been looking for you for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.07,0:21:47.57,Main,Catman,0,0,0,,It's been twenty years...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.57,0:21:49.61,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,I finally found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:21:59.94,Main,Catman,0,0,0,,How have you been?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:01.68,Main,Catgirl,0,0,0,,I'm okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.68,0:22:02.89,Main,Catman,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.89,0:22:04.67,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,Shall we give them some privacy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.25,0:22:08.20,Main,Tonome,0,0,0,,How about dinner?
